  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -IR verb; no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: *consumido*",
    "*consumir algo* = to consume/use up something (*consumir mucha energía* — to use a lot of energy; *consumir alcohol* — to drink alcohol)",
    "*consumirse* (reflexive) = to be consumed, to burn out, to waste away (*La vela se consumió* — The candle burnt down)",
    "Related: *el consumo* = consumption; *el/la consumidor/a* = consumer; *el consumismo* = consumerism"
  ],
